        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūsanga Zikilagi yapembilwe moto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būshika ī Zikilagi lūshikū lwa kadatū lwaaho. Baamaleki būsangwa bīdumīlile ī Negevu nī Zikilagi; aho bīheeba ī Zikilagi bīpemba moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma būbadima būja nabo, pye na a banhū a bangī abo baalīho hoi, bataale na bado. Batababūlagile, bakabadima dūhū būbajana ūko bajaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe aho baashika ī Zikilagi, būgūsanga ū nzengo gwabo gwapembilwe moto, na a bake babo pye na a baana babo, bagosha na bakīma baadiimilwe būtwalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe būtandūka kūlīla ng'hūngū, būlīla kūshisha jūūshila ī nguzu ja kūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bake ba ng'wa Daūdi būbīlī wabo baalī bajanwa, ū Ahinoamu wa Yezileeli nū Abigaili ūyo walī nke o ng'wa Nabaali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi akakoya no, nguno a banhū bakwe būyiwīla gīkī bamponde mawe; būlī munhū walī na būsūngū būtaale no ū mu moyo kūlwa nguno ya baana bakwe bagosha na bakīma. Alīyo ū Daūdi ūpandīka nguzu kūfuma kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūmūūja SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū ngabīji Abiasaali ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahimeleki, “Yenhage ī ng'hanjo ya nyagabīji ī ya makono magūhī.” Ū Abiasaali ūng'wenhela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūmūūja ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Nabakūūbīje a banhū benaba? Nakūbapandīka?” Ūnshokeja, “Bakūūbījage ūkūbapandīka, nīyo ūkūbataaja pyī īsho bajanile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe, banhū magana atandatū, būbūūka bajile, būūkashika ha longa lwa Besooli; bamò babo būsaaga henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno banhū magana abīlī bakanoga no, būlemeelwa ū kūlūkīla ū longa lwenūlo. Alīyo ū Daūdi ūkūūbīja na a banhū abo magana anè, abo baalī bataalī na nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būmona muna Misili alī ng'witogolo, būng'wenha a halī Daūdi. Būng'winha minzī ūng'wa, na shilīwa sha kūlya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibudīka lya ngatī gwa tiini jūūmīkije, na mabudīka abīlī ga ngatī gwa mizabibu. Aho walya ūng'wa na minzī ūdaama; nguno wal'atī naalya shilīwa nūūlū kūng'wa minzī ikanza lya shikū idatū līīmi na būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūmūūja, “Ū bebe ūlī o ng'wa nani? Na wafumaga halī?” Ūhaya, “Nalī muna Misili, nalī nsese wa muna Amaleki. Nakasaata ū baba būgonzo ūnileka, jashikaga shikū idatū ī haha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twīdumīlile Negevu ya Bakelesi, na sī ya Yuda na Negevu ya banhū ba lūdūgū lo Kelebu; nī Zikilagi, ī yene twīpemba na moto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla, “Ūdūgije kūnitwala ūko balī a banhū benabo?” Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Nilahīlīlage tame kūlī Mulungu gīkī ūtūnibūlaga, nūūlū ūtūnitūūla mu nkono go ng'wa baba būgonzo, hū nakūkūtwala ūko balī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbatūla Baamaleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo ūntwala ū Daūdi ūko baalī, na ng'hana būūkabasanga biyitaga mu mbūga bakūlyaga na kūng'wa; bakūbinaga na būyegi kūlwa nguno ya wingī wa shikolo īsho baalī baadima kūfuma ū mu sī ya Bafilisiti, nī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wilwisha būlūgū nabo kwandīja mhīndī ya lūshikū lwenūlo līīmi līlījīlīīla kūlibīla, kūshisha mhīndī ya lūshikū lwa ntondo yaho. Batapīlile ūlū ītī basūmba magana anè dūhū abo bakadamhīla ngamīla būpeela, būpūlūgūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūshikomoola pyī īsho baalī baashisola a Baamaleki benabo; a bake bakwe a babīlī nabo ūbapandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shitajimīīlile shikolo nūūlū shimò; na a banhū baalīho bose, bado na bataale, bayanda na baanikī; pyī nī nding'wa ī jingī, nī shikolo shose īsho baalī baasola. Pyī ī shose ūshishosha ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitugo ī jose ūjisola; a banhū bakwe būjiswaaga madale madaale bajitwalile ū kū jingī, kūnū bakūhayaga, “Ī jenīji nding'wa ja ng'wa Daūdi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūshika a ha longa lwa Besooli aho baalī baabaleka abo magana abīlī abo bakalemeelwa kūja hamò nang'hwe nguno bakanoga no no no. A banhū benabo būfuma kūnsūng'wanha ū Daūdi na a banhū abo walī nabo. Ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe aho wabeegeela a banhū benabo ūbagīsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo bamò ū mu banhū abo baalī baja nū Daūdi, baalī baabūbi na bahūnga; būhaya, “A bing'wana benaba angū bakalemeelwa ū kūja hamò nise, tūtūbinhaga nding'wa jose jose; ūlū a bake babo na a baana babo, a bene būlī ng'wene akūsola bakwe atwale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Ītī gīko badūgū bane, yaya ū kūshītīla gīko ī shikolo īsho watwinhile ū SEEBA; nguno hū ng'wene ūyo watūlang'hanile, nī libità īlo lyalī lyatūūbūkīlile walītūūlile wei ū mu makono gise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani akūgūzunya ūyo mulīgūhaya gwenūyo? Ū ngabo gwakwe ū wa kūsaaga akūshilang'hanaga ī shikolo, gūkūbiza gīt'ūmo gūlī ū ngabo gwakwe ū wa kūja ū kū būlūgū, a bose bakūgabanha mu kūlenganīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Daūdi ūshīta ī shenīshi kūbiza shilagīlo na kajīle ū mu Isilaeli kūshisha lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wahayūshika ī Zikilagi, nding'wa jimò ūbatwalīla banamhala ba sī ya Yuda, abo baalī banwani biye. Ūhaya, “Līlo inong'ho naamutūmīla kūfuma mu nding'wa ja kwīngīīla kū banishi ba ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banamhala abo akabatūmīla ī linong'ho lyenīlo baalī ba Beeseli, Lamoti ya Negevu na ba Yatili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
